OL,3,GNEWSAHuge data centre and solar farm
OL,4,Aplans revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been drawn up for a huge new
OL,7,Fdata centre and one of the UK's largest
OL,8,Fsolar farms near King's Lynn in
OL,9,FNorfolk.
OL,11,FDevelopers behind the Longmarsh Green
OL,12,FEnergy project said the data centre
OL,13,Fwould require up to 1 gigawatt (GW) of
OL,14,Fpower at any given time, while the
OL,15,Fsolar farm the firm wants to build
OL,16,Fwould generate up to 1.3GW.
OL,18,FEvolution Power Limited (EPL) said it
OL,19,Fwas seeking to construct two sites
OL,20,Fcovering around 4,695 acres (1,900
OL,21,Fhectares) and the proposals could
OL,22,Fattract #25bn of investment.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
